Positron unifies exploration and production work in one free, AI
assisted environment, empowering the full spectrum of data science in
Python and R.

NOTE:
Positron only supports 64-bit systems. 

At the moment, the script just repackages the Ubuntu/Debian binaries,
provided by upstream.

WARNING:
While this script build fine and the main application works, some files
requires newer GLIBC to work, so some features might not be working
unless you upgrade GLIBC from testing/
